From cc099c125537e919eae5af4f9e3c86f671c3a1bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiangyu Yin <xyin@anl.gov>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 08:44:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add fluorescence XAS from XRF fitting, project import and
 analysis tools

Fits the full multi-element detector spectrum at every scan point and shows the
result beside the window sum, each with its own quality checks. Adds beamline
readers and HDF5 layouts read through a bounded, link-free HDF5 layer, folder and
project import, LCF search and series, shared-peak series fits, and an optional
fast EXAFS backend offered only where it is installed. Backend CI now limits each
test and runs the XRF extraction tests as their own job.

XAScraft-commit: cc099c125537e919eae5af4f9e3c86f671c3a1bd
